[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/426323099","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/5056#issuecomment-426323099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5056","id":426323099,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyNjMyMzA5OQ==","user":{"login":"0asys","id":1131885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzE4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1131885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys","html_url":"https://github.com/0asys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-10-02T15:41:33Z","updated_at":"2018-10-05T20:15:08Z","body":"I would like also use this feature. seems to be a part of celery which is not actively used by the people.\r\n\r\nMy suggestion, to improve this:\r\n* [ ] better documentation how to configure (`accept_content = ['auth']` and `auth` serializer)\r\n* [X] remove silent fail on `app.setup_security()` if not correctly configured\r\n* [X] Unsigned Messages: `ContentDisallowed` should be dismissed (like a unkown task)\r\n* [ ] Invalid Signatures: `SecurityError` should also be dismissed.\r\n  *  a security error should take attention. some logging/alarming? I don't know what the standard mechanisms in celery are for this case.\r\n* [X] New Worker should introduce themselves with a signed message\r\n* [ ] Proposal: A configuration setting for verifying the certificates against a CA.\r\n* [X] Proposal: Make digest of OpenSSL Sign configurable\r\n  * Change default digest from `sha1` to something modern (sha256) ? Performance impact should be considered. (https://pyopenssl.org/en/stable/api/crypto.html#digest-names)\r\n* [X] Test coverage\r\n\r\nI would like to participate to improve this, but it will be my first contribution to celery.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/426323099/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"0asys","id":1131885,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzE4ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1131885?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys","html_url":"https://github.com/0asys","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0asys/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/426333931","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/5056#issuecomment-426333931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5056","id":426333931,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyNjMzMzkzMQ==","user":{"login":"auvipy","id":6212603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTI2MDM=","avatar_url":"ht