lery","homepage":"https://docs.celeryq.dev","size":36397,"stargazers_count":28268,"watchers_count":28268,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4989,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":772,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["amqp","python","python-library","python3","queue-tasks","queue-workers","queued-jobs","redis","redis-queue","sqs","sqs-queue","task-manager","task-runner","task-scheduler"],"visibility":"public","forks":4989,"open_issues":772,"watchers":28268,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/pulls/5091","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/5091","diff_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/5091.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/pull/5091.patch","merged_at":"2019-01-07T16:02:53Z"},"body":"## Description\r\n\r\nthis improves the message signing described in   \r\nhttp://docs.celeryproject.org/en/latest/userguide/security.html#message-signing\r\n\r\nThis fixes #5056 . see the issue for ongoing discussion\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n* [X] better documentation how to configure (`accept_content = ['auth']` and `auth` serializer)\r\n* [X] remove silent fail on `app.setup_security()` if not correctly configured\r\n* [X] Unsigned Messages: `ContentDisallowed` should be dismissed (like a unkown task)\r\n* [ ] Invalid Signatures: `SecurityError` should also be dismissed.\r\n  *  a security error should take attention. some logging/alarming? I don't know what the standard mechanisms in celery are for this case.\r\n* [ ] ~~Handle Pidbox/Event exceptions if serializers don't match (auth - json/json - auth)~~\r\n  * [ ] ~~Gossip~~\r\n  * [ ] ~~Mingle~~\r\n* [X] New Worker should introduce themselves with a signed message\r\n* [ ] ~~Proposal: A configuration setting for verifying the certificates against a CA.~~\r\n* [X] Proposal: Make digest of OpenSSL Sign configurable\r\n  * Change default digest from `sha1` to something modern (sha256) ? Performance impact should be considered. (https://pyopenssl.org/en/stable/api/crypto.html#digest-names)\r\n* [X] Test coverage\r\n* [X] Integration Test\r\n* [X] Replace pyOpenSSL with pyca/crypthography\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5091/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":4,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5091/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2057956728,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50MjA1Nzk1NjcyOA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/events/2057956728","actor":{"login":"auvipy","id":6212603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTI2MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6212603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy","html_url":"https://github.com/auvipy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admi